abstract: "AxonOS organs wired together and run deterministically from a seed: a reference session, and a reference BCI that carries synthetic EEG to application intent through the consent boundary and verifies that nothing reaches the application after consent is withdrawn. Byte-exact transcripts are diffed in CI."
